# Strava Integration Configuration
# 
# To enable Strava integration:
# 1. Create a Strava application at https://www.strava.com/settings/api
# 2. Use these settings in your Strava app:
#    - Application Name: Trivia Run
#    - Category: Mobile App  
#    - Website: https://triviarun.app (or any valid URL)
#    - Authorization Callback Domain: triviarun
# 3. Copy your Client ID and Client Secret below
# 4. Rename this file to .env (remove .example)
# 5. Update the values in src/services/strava.ts

# Your Strava App Client ID (public)
STRAVA_CLIENT_ID=your_strava_client_id_here

# Your Strava App Client Secret (keep secret!)
STRAVA_CLIENT_SECRET=your_strava_client_secret_here

# IMPORTANT: In your Strava app settings, set:
# - Authorization Callback Domain: httpbin.org
# 
# This uses httpbin.org as a testing redirect service that Strava accepts.
# The OAuth flow will show the authorization code in the browser,
# which you can manually extract for testing.